{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 20:10:49.309378", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Description\\nThe network is an SDN star topology with one central switch (switch_0) and multiple edge switches (switch_1, switch_2, switch_3, switch_4). Hosts (host_1, host_2, host_3, host_4) are connected to edge switches, and all devices share a single access subnet (10.0.0.0/24). The SDN controller operates at 20.0.0.100 and manages the switches via OpenFlow.\\n\\n#### Observations\\n1. **Host Reachability Results**:\\n   - The reachability test between hosts indicates abnormal behavior. Specifically:\\n     - Host-to-host communication results are marked as \"unknown\" for all tested pairs.\\n     - No transmission (tx), reception (rx), or round-trip time (RTT) data is available.\\n     - Loss percentage and other metrics are undefined.\\n\\n2. **Implications**:\\n   - The \"unknown\" status suggests that either the reachability tests failed to execute properly or there is a fundamental issue preventing communication between hosts.\\n   - This could indicate problems with the SDN controller, OpenFlow configurations, or the physical connectivity between switches and hosts.\\n\\n#### Next Steps\\nTo further diagnose the root cause, the following areas need investigation:\\n1. **SDN Controller Health**:\\n   - Verify the status of the SDN controller at 20.0.0.100.\\n   - Check OpenFlow connections between the controller and switches.\\n\\n2. **Switch Connectivity**:\\n   - Inspect the central switch (switch_0) and edge switches (switch_1 to switch_4) for configuration or hardware issues.\\n   - Validate the management/control network (20.0.0.0/24) connectivity.\\n\\n3. **Host Network Configuration**:\\n   - Examine the network settings of hosts (host_1 to host_4) to ensure proper IP assignment and routing.\\n\\n4. **OpenFlow Rules**:\\n   - Review the flow rules installed on the switches to confirm proper forwarding behavior.\\n\\n#### Conclusion\\nThe network exhibits abnormal behavior, with all host-to-host communication tests resulting in \"unknown\" status. This points to potential issues with the SDN controller, switch configurations, or OpenFlow rules. Further investigation is required to pinpoint the exact cause of the anomaly., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='5f4f6b17-7e16-4aa5-be01-915994bbf908'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
